    "answer": "1. 依次填：**+**、**−**、**+**。\n   - \\(-a-b=-(a+b)\\)\n   - \\(-a+b=-(a-b)\\)\n   - \\(-\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{3}=-(\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{3})\\)\n\n2.\n\\[\n\\begin{aligned}\n-\\dfrac{5}{6}-\\dfrac{7}{12}-\\dfrac{1}{4}\n&= -\\left( \\dfrac{5}{6}+\\dfrac{7}{12}+\\dfrac{1}{4} \\right) \\\\\n&= -\\left( \\dfrac{10}{12}+\\dfrac{7}{12}+\\dfrac{3}{12} \\right) \\\\\n&= -\\dfrac{20}{12} \\\\\n&= -\\dfrac{5}{3}\n\\end{aligned}\n\\]\n\n**口诀：** 负号提出来，括号里全变号；加变减、减变加，正负别搞混。",
